#~ msgid ""
#~ "<h1>Configuration Complete</h1><p>We now know enough to set up a working "
#~ "MLDonkey configuration. Press \"Finish\" below to get things started.</"
#~ "p><p>Remember, your finished downloads go into the <em>incoming</em> "
#~ "folder under your work folder.</p><p>Enjoy KMLDonkey!</p>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<h1>Podešavanje završeno</h1><p>Sada znamo dovoljno da bi postavili radna "
#~ "podešavanja MLDonkey-ja. Pritisnite „Završi“ da biste pokrenuli stvar.</"
#~ "p><p>Upamtite, vaša završena preuzimanja idu u fasciklu <em>incoming</em> "
#~ "u vašoj radnoj fascikli.</p><p>Uživajte u KMLDonkey-u!</p>"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<h1>Download MLDonkey</h1><p>The first thing you need to do is obtain an "
#~ "MLDonkey core. This is the actual file sharing tool for which KMLDonkey "
#~ "acts as a frontend.</p><p>Visit one of the web sites listed below (just "
#~ "click on the links), and download a binary package suitable for your "
#~ "system; alternatively, if your system's package manager provides an "
#~ "MLDonkey package, you can install that instead, and note where the \"mlnet"
#~ "\" binary is installed for later (usually in <em>/usr/bin</em>).</p><ul>"
#~ "%1</ul><p>Extract the package somewhere convenient, and press \"Next\". "
#~ "Do not worry about configuring or starting what you downloaded; we will "
#~ "do that later.</p>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<h1>Preuzmi MLDonkey</h1><p>Prvo morate nabaviti jezgro MLDonkey-ja. Ovo "
#~ "je u stvari alat za dijeljenje datoteka kome KMLDonkey služi kao "
#~ "interfejs.</p><p>Posetite jedan od dolje navedenih veb sajtova (samo "
#~ "kliknite na vezu), i preuzmite binarni paket pogodan za vaš sistem; "
#~ "alternativno, ako menadžer paketa vašeg sistema pruža paket MLDonkey, "
#~ "možete ga instalirati i provjeriti gdje je izvršna datoteka „mlnet“ "
#~ "instaliran, trebaće vam taj podatak za kasnije (obično je to <em>/usr/"
#~ "bin</em>).</p><ul>%1</ul><p>Raspakujte paket na neko pogodno mjesto i "
#~ "pritisnite \"Sljedeći\". Ne brinite o podešavanju ili pokretanju toga što "
#~ "ste preuzeli, za to ćemo se pobrinuti kasnije.</p>"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<h1>KMLDonkey Setup Wizard</h1><p>Making KMLDonkey work can be a daunting "
#~ "task for the uninitiated. This wizard will guide you through the basic "
#~ "steps needed to get you up and running.</p><p>If you understand how to "
#~ "set up and administer an MLDonkey core and want to configure KMLDonkey "
#~ "yourself, you can safely skip this wizard; otherwise, press the \"Next\" "
#~ "button below to get started.</p><p><em>Read the text in the wizard "
#~ "carefully; everything in it is important.</em></p><p><b>WARNING:</b> "
#~ "Running this wizard will <em>erase</em> any previous core connections you "
#~ "may have configured. It will not affect any previous MLDonkey cores you "
#~ "have installed.</p>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<h1>Čarobnjak za podešavanje KMLDonkey-ja</h1><p>Natjerati KMLDonkey da "
#~ "radi može biti zastrašujući zadatak za neupućene. Ovaj čarobnjak će vas "
#~ "provesti kroz osnovne korake potrebne da počnete sa radom.</p><p>Ako "
#~ "znate kako da podesite i administrirate jezgro MLDonkey-ja i želite sami "
#~ "da podesite KMLDonkey, možete slobodno preskočiti ovaj čarobnjak; u "
#~ "suprotnom, pritisnite dugme „Sljedeći“ da biste počeli.</"
#~ "p><p><em>Pažljivo čitajte tekst u čarobnjaku, sve je važno.</em></"
#~ "p><p><b>UPOZORENJE:</b> Pokretanje ovog čarobnjaka će <em>izbrisati</em> "
#~ "sve prethodne veze jezgra koje imate podešene. On neće uticati na "
#~ "prethodna jezgra MLDonkey-a koje imate instalirana.</p>"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<h1>Launcher Settings</h1><p>Now, you need to decide when you want the "
#~ "core to be running. The easiest way is to start the core whenever you "
#~ "launch KMLDonkey, and shut it down when you close the application. You "
#~ "can also elect to have it running continuously when you are logged into "
#~ "your KDE session, regardless of whether KMLDonkey is running.</p>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<h1>Postavke pokretača</h1><p>Sada, morate da odlučite kada želite da se "
#~ "jezgro pokrene. Najlakši način je da se jezgro pokrene kadgod pokrenete "
#~ "KMLDonkey, a zatvori kada izađete iz programa. Takođe možete izabrati da "
#~ "radi neprestano kada ste prijavljeni u KDE sesiju, bez obzira da li "
#~ "KMLDonkey radi ili ne.</p>"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<h1>Locate Your Core</h1><p>Now, select the full path to your MLDonkey "
#~ "core, which you (or your distribution) downloaded earlier, below. If the "
#~ "archive you downloaded only contained one file, then this is the core, "
#~ "otherwise look for the file called \"mlnet\".</p>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<h1>Nađite vaše jezgro</h1><p>Sada, ispod izaberite punu putanju do "
#~ "jezgra MLDonkey-a, kojeg ste vi ili vaša distribucija ranije preuzeli. "
#~ "Ako arhiva koju ste preuzeli sadrži samo jednu datoteku, onda je to "
#~ "jezgro. U suprotnom potražite datoteka koji se zove „mlnet“.</p>"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<h1>Name Your Core</h1><p>The last thing you need to do is assign a name "
#~ "to your core. This is for your own use only; the default \"MLDonkey\" is "
#~ "quite adequate, but you can choose anything you like.</p>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<h1>Imenujte vaše jezgro</h1><p>Posljednja stvar koju treba da uradite je "
#~ "da dodijelite ime vašem jezgru. Ovo je samo za vašu upotrebu; "
#~ "podrazumijevano „MLDonkey“ je sasvim odgovarajuće, ali vi možete izabrati "
#~ "šta želite.</p>"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<h1>Set Up a Work Folder</h1><p>You need a work folder for your MLDonkey "
#~ "core. This is where it stores its configuration data, temporary files and "
#~ "finished downloads. You should place it on a disk partition with a lot of "
#~ "free space.</p><p>NOTE: You can change the locations where it stores "
#~ "temporary files and finished downloads later, if you like.</p><p>Select "
#~ "your work folder here:</p>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<h1>Podesite radnu fasciklu</h1><p>Morate imati radnu fascilu za vaše "
#~ "MLDonkey jezgro. Ovdje on pohranjuje svoje podatke o podešavanjima, "
#~ "privremene datoteke i završena preuzimanja. Trebalo bi da ga postavita na "
#~ "particiju na kojoj ima dosta slobodnog prostora.</p><p>Beleška: Kasnije, "
#~ "ako želite, možete promijeniti mjesto gdje šije se smještati privremene "
#~ "datoteke i završeni prenosi.</p><p>Ovde podesite vašu radnu fascilu:</p>"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<h2>MLDonkey Applet</h2><p>MLDonkey status displays and KMLDonkey "
#~ "launcher.</p>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<h2>Aplet MLDonkey-ja</h2><p>Prikazi statusa MLDonkey-ja i pokretač "
#~ "KMLDonkey-ja.</p>"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p><b>Changing the text encoding may result in unpredictable behavior.</"
#~ "b></p>\n"
#~ "<p>You must take care to select an encoding that is relatively compatible "
#~ "with ISO 8859-1, as you are guaranteed to receive ISO 8859-1 encoded text "
#~ "from MLDonkey. Even so, KMLDonkey <i>may crash or fail to work properly</"
#~ "i> if you use any text encoding other than ISO 8859-1. Proceed at your "
#~ "own risk.</p>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<p><b>Promena kodiranja teksta može rezultovati nepredviđenim ponašanjem."
#~ "</b></p>\n"
#~ "<p>Morate paziti da izaberete kodiranje koje je relativno kompatibilno sa "
#~ "ISO 8859-1, pošto vam je garantovano da ćete dobijati ISO 8859-1 kodiran "
#~ "tekst od MLDonkey-ja. Čak i tada, MLDonkey <i>može pasti ili raditi "
#~ "neispravno</i> ako koristite bilo koje kodiranje osim ISO 8859-1. "
